    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "3c5dbbeb6101a6ad0c6f": "Train me.",
        "6645ba013c6e8d6c3e29": "Bena works like one possessed. Day and night I have seen her bent over these potions, often going without sleep or food. I know our undead allies need help, but I begin to fear she will do herself an injury.",
        "94099cafa2da49b81a4d": "I must have broken hundreds of vials when I first began brewing potions. The glass was so fragile in my clumsy hands. I hope you are more cautious than I was.",
        "9f29a1416e3468a5bd46": "Your capacity for learning has outstripped mine. You will need to talk to Bena Winterhoof over there for further instruction. Please don't take too much of her time, though. She needs her rest."
      },
      "name": "Kray",
      "subName": "Journeyman Alchemist",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
